    "detailed_description": "<h1>MY NEW GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Hack Grid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A retro puzzle game with short but complex puzzles. The goal is to clear the board until only one piece remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only one piece must remain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.poster.avif?t=1745740661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.webm?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.mp4?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Pieces can only move on other pieces of different color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consume other pieces until only one remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different piece, different rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.poster.avif?t=1745740661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.webm?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.mp4?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Only some pieces can move, others are stationary, some change color and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What awaits you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90 challenging levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound Blaster 16 style soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience. Not a fan of the CRT-look? Turn it off! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorblind support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with mouse only or use keyboard hotkeys! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game jukebox. Choose which songs from the retro soundtrack you want to hear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 languages available (Czech, Dutch, English, Finnish, German, Hindi, Russian and Spanish) </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is Hack Grid?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A retro puzzle game with short but complex puzzles. The goal is to clear the board until only one piece remains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Only one piece must remain</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.poster.avif?t=1745740661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.webm?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/d6c5cec1f87788ed7e3c01913817043d.mp4?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Pieces can only move on other pieces of different color.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consume other pieces until only one remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different piece, different rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.poster.avif?t=1745740661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.webm?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1543290/extras/09f90e37b79072c2e721d1b859a19a29.mp4?t=1745740661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Only some pieces can move, others are stationary, some change color and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What awaits you</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90 challenging levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound Blaster 16 style soundtrack </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your experience. Not a fan of the CRT-look? Turn it off! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colorblind support </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with mouse only or use keyboard hotkeys! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game jukebox. Choose which songs from the retro soundtrack you want to hear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 languages available (Czech, Dutch, English, Finnish, German, Hindi, Russian and Spanish) </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Deceptively simple. Infinitely complex. Hack Grid is a retro puzzle game that will test your wits as it brings you back in time. Move the pieces around until only one remains. Re-live the days of DOS gaming.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Czech, Dutch, Finnish, Russian, Spanish - Latin America",
